SUMMARY:Thursday Night Mix\, Mingle and Movie Night! (Film Choice: MICHAEL
 )
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 \\*\\*Kindly read the details carefully below\\*\\*\n\nPlease join me and 
 my other groups for a great evening of **Mix\, Mingling and the brand new 
 Film- Michael.**\n\nMix and Mingle beforehand as we get settled in\, get t
 o know each other\, share some laughs\, and get ready to see a great film.
  With a bonus group discussion immidiately following the film.\n\nIncludin
 g a pre-movie mix and mingle\, movie related ice-breaker (to get to know e
 veryone) in the cool (V.I.P lounge)\n\\*Dinner/Food/Beverages avaialbe in 
 the lounge prior to film\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we can a
 nticipate a great turn out\n\n**Where to Meet when you arrive?**\n\n***\\*
 Meet me and the others right outside the box office beside the air hockey 
 and arcade games)* (7:00 pm to 7:30 pm)**\n\n{Further Details below:}\n\nS
 incerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Thursd
 ay Night Mix\, Mingle and Movie Night! (Film Choice: MICHAEL)**\n\n-A grea
 t night to mix\, mingle\, make new friends and go see a great movie\n\n**A
 bout Film: Michael**\n\nThe story of pop superstar Michael Jackson -- from
  his extraordinary early days in the Jackson 5 to the visionary artist who
 se creative ambition fuels a relentless pursuit to become the biggest ente
 rtainer in the world.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:** for Mix and Mingle before and after film\n5 doll
 ars by e transfer in advance to steveflemming11@gmail.com\nor by cash in p
 erson)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n(Movie fee- s
 eparate- we will purchase our ticket together when we all arrive)\n\n**Whe
 re and When to Find Us?**\n\n**Location:** **(Inside Yonge & Eglinton Cent
 re)**\n2300 Yonge Street\, Toronto\, ON M4P 1E4\n\n**(We will meet out fro
 nt of box office beside the air hockey table and arcade)**\n(Simply walk u
 p the steps from the outside and come into the Centre- turn left and we wi
 ll be waiting right there)\n\n**Arrive between 7:00 pm and 7:30 pm**\n(We 
 will head to the V.I.P. lounge for a beverage\, food (optional) before hea
 ding to see the film) (optional)\n\n**Close to the Yonge and Eglinton subw
 ay**\n(Lots of parking in the area and 2 minute walk from the subway stati
 on)
