SUMMARY:The Magnificent Karaoke Mix and Mingle Party! (Saturday\, May 2nd)
  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for a Magnificent May\, Saturday Night Karaoke Party where 
 we will meet at our groups cozy location\, **The Celtic Irish Pub**. **(on
  main floor)** This friendly pub is conveniently located at Yonge & Davisv
 ille- very close to the Davisville subway.\nFree Parking on Duplex (just a
  block west of Yonge)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Where and When to Meet us?**\n**
 Location: Celtic Irish Pub**\n(Just mention Steve from Meetup when you arr
 ive- to find our reserved section)\n**Date:** Saturday May 2nd\, 2026\n**A
 ddress:** 1954 Yonge St Toronto\, ON M4S 3E5 (on main floor)\n**Arrive bet
 ween:** 7:30 pm and 9: 30 pm (if you can) (Dinner Menu Provided)\n**Free P
 arking** on Duplex just west of Yonge\n**Taking Subway:** 1 minute walk no
 rth of Yonge-Davisville Subway\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\
 nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nEvent Details:\n**The Magnificent Karaoke Mix and Mingle
  Party! (Saturday\, May 2nd)**\n**(On Main floor)**\n\n-We will meet insid
 e (reserved seating) and look forward to a great night to mix\, mingle\, s
 hare some laughs and then Karaoke after the mixer\n\n\\*Plan to come for d
 inner too if you like (a fabulous dinner menu)\n\\*Invite your friends too
 \; or come on your own (either way\, we're going to have a blast and make 
 lots of new friends!)\n\\*Choose to sing or merely enjoy a super enthused 
 energy all night long!\n**Please be courteous to the Restaurant and Staff:
 **\n\\*One beverage (preferably two beverages if you are staying for more 
 than two hours) or appetizer/meal minimum to support the venue-plan to com
 e for dinner too if you like :)\n\\*Joined by my other groups too\; so we 
 can anticipate a fantastic turn out :)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**EVENT FEE and A
 rrival Times:**\n\n\\*Please arrive between 7:30 pm and 9:30 pm (if you ca
 n)\n\n**Event Fee: (Cash only at the door)**\n10 dollars cash or in advanc
 e by e transfer too:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@g
 mail.com/)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n\\*Free Parking on Duple
 x (block west of Yonge) Residential area\, with paid street parking and pa
 rking lot on Yonge street
