SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday May 7th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nSongs that I have written for well 
 over 36 years.\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWonderful and Beautufi ne
 w songs every week\, including some of our favorites!\n\n\\*You are welcom
 e to join us any time after 8:30 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcom
 e to come on later in the evening as well\n**\\*\\*Attend for free if you 
 like - if it's your first time attending :)**\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nS
 incerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Songwriter/Producer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:
 \n**Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday May 7th)**\n*
 *(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs by Songwriter and Producer St
 eve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\, spiritual songs\, songs abou
 t nature\, our culture\, our past\, our future\, relationships and our liv
 es\n\nI'll be playing a mix of songs using a fusion of mixed genres like\,
  **Folk\, Traditional Folk\, Country\, Blue Grass\, Singer Song Writer\, S
 oft Rock\, Easy Listening\, Classic Rock\, R & B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult Co
 ntemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**p and many others genres too. So please sit ba
 ck and get ready to have an amazing auditory experience in the comforts of
  your own home :)\n\n\\*You can come on and off at any time during the nig
 ht- starting at 8:30 pm\n\n**About Steve Flemming:**\nHighly influenced by
  the great singer songwriters of the 50s\, 60s\, 70s\, 80s and 90s. I have
  been writing my own songs since 1990. Songs about life\, love\, loss\, ho
 pe\, faith\, joy\, romance\, memories\, spirituality and heartbreak. Songs
  that are universal\, heartfelt and often relevant to the lives of many ot
 hers.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You Can: (
 P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n**steve
 flemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly apprecia
 ted to help support this meaningful musical endeavor and song loving commu
 nity\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonia
 ls from Past Events:**\nYour songs are wonder-full\, speak to emotions\, e
 xperiences and moments we've all felt and lived. S. B.\nSteve Flemming is 
 an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the soul. He transforms everyday t
 houghts and life into beautiful poetry and magical tunes. Amazing stuff ye
 t again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a night of heartfelt\, exhila
 rating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for having me my friend. I lov
 e your words\, they calm me and energize me at the same time I'll look for
 ward to your next invite\nM.Z.\nThese great songs definitely helped me to 
 decompress after a long day. Keep up the song writing Steve\, these are gr
 eat! - S.S.\nThank you so much for a relaxing evening and sharing your ins
 piring music Steve! I am excited to hear more and I hope you do this again
 !! - C.B\nLovely songs and a great vibe with wonderful people. I couldn’
 t have asked for a better way to close my day. Huge thanks Steve\, for inv
 iting me! I truly enjoyed every moment! - N.A.\nThe lyrics are amazing. Fr
 om the heart...\nThanks Steve for the amazing tunes. I'm truly blown away.
  Very glad I joined.\n\\- E\\.E\\.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
